# GUI / Preview Pane

Full text: `docs/UX_STANDARDS.md`. Hard constraints when editing UI:

- **3 panes:** left conversations · centre chat · right preview. Settings = small gear, top.
- **(i) info affordance** on every required input/output. Hover/click reveals WHAT / WHY / EXAMPLE.
  Hint copy is data (`FieldHint` in config), never hardcoded in the component.
- **Theme tokens only** in `GUI/src/theme` (Law 2). No raw hex/rgb in components.
- **No clutter.** If removing an element doesn't hurt understanding or action, remove it.
- **Truthful state.** Loading, streaming, degraded, and error are visible and honest.
- **Browser-verify** every GUI change (desktop / iPad / mobile). "It compiles" is not evidence.
- Confirm current phase in `docs/ROADMAP.md` before GUI work. Phases 0–3 are done; Phase 0 “no GUI”
  no longer applies. Owner-directed theme work uses ADR-0005 + `docs/new-frontend` design assets.

**Design system:** the token architecture, colour contract, worklog + (i) contracts, and the
verification gate are enforced in detail by `design-system.mdc` and documented in
`APP/GUI/design/DESIGN.md`. Open `APP/GUI/design/protean-style-guide.html` before building any page.
